{
  "_readme": [
    "Real photographs for flashcards (Picture-Word game, viewer, etc.).",
    "Parsed by lib/core/services/flashcard_photo_service.dart; downloaded + cached on first view (NOT bundled in the APK).",
    "",
    "You can paste a share-page URL directly — postimg.cc/<id> pages are auto-resolved to the",
    "direct i.postimg.cc image by lib/core/services/media_url_resolver.dart. Direct URLs work too.",
    "",
    "Resolution order for a card's main photo:",
    "  1. overrides['<Category label>__<english word lowercased>']  (used below), else",
    "  2. <base_url>/<Category label>/<English word>.<ext>  (only if base_url is set).",
    "",
    "GALLERIES (extra examples): 'galleries' maps the same key to a LIST of extra photo URLs.",
    "The Examples button (viewer) then shows the main photo + these extras in a swipeable gallery.",
    "Best for 'simple' cards — e.g. add 2-3 red objects under 'Colors & Shapes__red', or three of an",
    "item under 'Numbers__three'. Example:",
    "  \"galleries\": { \"Colors & Shapes__red\": [\"https://postimg.cc/aaaa\", \"https://postimg.cc/bbbb\"] }",
    "",
    "Category labels: Animals, Colors & Shapes, Numbers, Body Parts, Food & Drinks, Family & Greetings,",
    "Clothing, Weather, Classroom, Transportation, Emotions, Days & Time, Actions."
  ],
